- **Availability Check**: For December 5, 2024, the only available time slot is at **10:00 AM** (Japan Standard Time, JST). There are no slots after 6:00 PM on this date. Tickets are available for the morning slot (up to 12 adults per reservation, priced at approximately €31.10 / $33.51 USD per adult, with free cancellation up to 1 day before). Since this doesn't meet your after-6 PM requirement, no suitable options in Tokyo.

