- **Availability Check**: Tickets are available for slots after 10:30 AM on December 6, 2024 (all in JST). Plenty of tickets remain (up to 10,000 available per slot, with max 6 per reservation). Free cancellation up to 1 day before. Pricing is the same across categories: approximately €31.10 / $33.51 USD per person. Here's the detailed breakdown of available time slots:

